  "description": "Run an ASP.NET Core web host and Kestrel server inside a .NET MAUI app: start it, stop it, and find out what address to show the user.\nASP.NET Core comes from netstandard2.0 packages, which is what lets it run on Android and iOS: the Microsoft.AspNetCore.App shared framework has no runtime pack for any mobile platform. Despite the name there are no patches left in it.",
  "iconFile": "me.png",
